<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 10 bln levs 4-wk discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 10 bln levs 4-wk discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry on Friday placed a four-week discount T-bill issue with a par value of 10 billion levs, yielding 5.20 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial institution or institutions the issue was placed.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Price in percent of par:</p>
<p>@</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3032797006</p>
<p> Term			    four weeks</p>
<p> Par value		     10,000 million levs</p>
<p> Issue date		    May 2</p>
<p> Maturity date		 May 30</p>
<p> Avg accepted price	  95.06 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     5.20 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
